                "test('a grip dragged places its item among the others by the pointer",
            ],
        },
    ]}
>
    <Section level={3} title="Rank deals by dragging or with the keys">
        <p>A sortable list is a <code>listbox</code>. Spread <code>list</code> on the list and
            <code>item(entry).item</code> on each item. It is one stop in the tab order: the
            arrows, Home and End move what is active, and a click, a ⌘ or Ctrl click and a Shift
            click select as in any listbox. Alt with ArrowUp or ArrowDown moves the item a place,
            or the whole selection where the item is in it. Spread <code>.handle</code> on a grip
            to drag them; it is for the pointer alone, hidden from the keyboard. Each move is
            read out through <code>announce</code>, so stand an <code>announce.host</code> on
            the page.</p>
        <Example code={rankDeals}><RankDeals /></Example>
    </Section>
</Doc>
